{"id":"b9a8f6982564aea6","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-kripke-content.md","title":"Kripke Content","display":"df-kripke-content — Kripke Content","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-kripke-content","aliases":["72-df-kripke-content"],"display":"df-kripke-content — Kripke Content","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Explicit local propositional intuitionistic Kripke semantics; not attributed to a numbered book definition","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_kind":"local-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-kripke-content"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-kripke-content</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kripke-content — Kripke Content"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Explicit local propositional intuitionistic Kripke semantics; not attributed to a numbered book definition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span> 是命题字母集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IPFml}(\\mathsf P)\">\\(\\operatorname{IPFml}(\\mathsf P)\\)</span> 为由P、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to\">\\(\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to\\)</span> 有限生成的公式集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,\\le,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle W,\\le,V\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，≤为反身传递关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf P\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf P\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span> 满足上闭性。否定缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash\">\\(\\Vdash\\)</span> 以下按公式结构递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,v\\in W\">\\(w,v\\in W\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}\">\\(\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> 是其模型相对内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nw\\Vdash p&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ w\\in V(p),&amp;w\\nVdash\\bot,&amp;\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\land B&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ (w\\Vdash A\\land w\\Vdash B),\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\lor B&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ (w\\Vdash A\\lor w\\Vdash B),\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\to B&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall v\\in W\\ (w\\le v\\to(v\\Vdash A\\to v\\Vdash B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A)&amp;:=\\{w\\in W:w\\Vdash A\\},\\\\\nw\\in\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A)\\land w\\le v&amp;\\ \\longrightarrow\\ v\\in\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nw\\Vdash p&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ w\\in V(p),&amp;w\\nVdash\\bot,&amp;\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\land B&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ (w\\Vdash A\\land w\\Vdash B),\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\lor B&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ (w\\Vdash A\\lor w\\Vdash B),\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\to B&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall v\\in W\\ (w\\le v\\to(v\\Vdash A\\to v\\Vdash B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A)&amp;:=\\{w\\in W:w\\Vdash A\\},\\\\\nw\\in\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A)\\land w\\le v&amp;\\ \\longrightarrow\\ v\\in\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&amp;:=\\mathsf P\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nI_{n+1}&amp;:=I_n\\cup\\{A\\land B:A,B\\in I_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\lor B:A,B\\in I_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in I_n\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{IPFml}(\\mathsf P)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}I_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&amp;:=\\mathsf P\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nI_{n+1}&amp;:=I_n\\cup\\{A\\land B:A,B\\in I_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\lor B:A,B\\in I_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in I_n\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{IPFml}(\\mathsf P)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}I_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>内容的上闭性不再作为强制关系已经满足的未定义假设；原子情形来自V，合取/析取按归纳，蕴含情形由≤传递性。这里只定义直觉主义命题Kripke语义，不与VII中模态可达关系及GL的强制条款混用。谓词量化需要额外的单调域及赋值接口，未在此伪装成已有定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IPFml}(\\mathsf P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,\\le,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\mathsf P\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash","display":false},{"tex":"w,v\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nw\\Vdash p&\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ w\\in V(p),&w\\nVdash\\bot,&\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\land B&\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ (w\\Vdash A\\land w\\Vdash B),\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\lor B&\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ (w\\Vdash A\\lor w\\Vdash B),\\\\\nw\\Vdash A\\to B&\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall v\\in W\\ (w\\le v\\to(v\\Vdash A\\to v\\Vdash B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A)&:=\\{w\\in W:w\\Vdash A\\},\\\\\nw\\in\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A)\\land w\\le v&\\ \\longrightarrow\\ v\\in\\operatorname{KC}_{\\mathcal M}(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&:=\\mathsf P\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nI_{n+1}&:=I_n\\cup\\{A\\land B:A,B\\in I_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\lor B:A,B\\in I_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in I_n\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{IPFml}(\\mathsf P)&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}I_n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2135,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-kripke-content|df-kripke-content — Kripke Content]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-kripke-content — Kripke Content](72-df-kripke-content.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-kripke-content|df-kripke-content — Kripke Content]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-kripke-content]]"}],"outgoing":[]}